        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Baldwin DEL-SBE, Del Mar Handleset with Square Bevel Interior Trim</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Del Mar Handleset comes with a matching square bevel escutcheon for the interior trim, making it a great choice for transitional homes. With its finger on the pulse of the hottest look in home décor, this front door handle is a popular choice for designers and homeowners alike. It is backed by a lifetime manufacturer's warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. It is available in emergency egress single cylinder or dummy functions. Choose from any of the 6 interior trim options and an array of beautiful finish choices so that you can select the best fit for your personal style and your needs. The Del Mar Egress Handleset with Square Bevel Interior Trim will fit doors with thicknesses between 1-3/4 inches and 2-1/2 inches and it comes with an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection Del Mar Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Del Mar Entrance Set with Square Rose Interior Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 16-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-8/9\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Height: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-13/32\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Del Mar Handleset",
                "description": "The Del Mar Handleset comes with a matching square bevel escutcheon for the interior trim, making it a great choice for transitional homes. With its finger on the pulse of the hottest look in home décor, this front door handle is a popular choice for designers and homeowners alike. It is backed by a lifetime manufacturer's warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. It is available in emergency egress single cylinder or dummy functions. Choose from any of the 6 interior trim options and an array of beautiful finish choices so that you can select the best fit for your personal style and your needs. The Del Mar Egress Handleset with Square Bevel Interior Trim will fit doors with thicknesses between 1-3/4 inches and 2-1/2 inches and it comes with an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
                "keywords": "BAL-DEL-SBE, Baldwin DEL-SBE, Del Mar Handlesets, Del Mar Front Door Handles, traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, rectangular handlesets, Baldwin Reserve Collection Del Mar Handlesets, Del Mar Entrance set with Square Rose Interior Trims,  Del Mar Handleset with Traditional Square Interior Trim, Del Mar Handleset with Square Bevel Interior Trim, Del Mar egress Handleset, panic proof handlesets,"
